# ELASTICSEARCH WORKFLOW RULES

**Client:** official Elastic CLI (`@elastic/cli`), invoked only through `Cursor-Project/scripts/elastic-phoenix.py`.
**Procedure:** `.cursor/skills/phoenix-elasticsearch/SKILL.md`.
**Config:** `Cursor-Project/config/elasticsearch/contexts.yml`.

Elasticsearch MCP is removed. Do not call `ElasticsearchDev`, `ElasticsearchTest`, `ElasticsearchTest2ES`, `ElasticsearchTest2SLR`, `ElasticsearchProd`, or `es_search_logs` / `es_error_summary` / `es_sql_query` / `es_search` / `es_count` / `es_field_values` / `es_list_indices` / `es_index_mapping` / `es_cluster_health`. A `beforeMCPExecution` hook denies those calls.

**Chat line when logs were read:** `Elasticsearch source: official Elastic CLI (@elastic/cli via elastic-phoenix).`

